"options.hsg.mvs.enablevotetimechange.detail" : "When a given number of players have not voted yet, change the remaining vote time.<br>Nothing changes if that time is shorter than the remaining vote time."
"options.hsg.mvs.triggercount" : "Players Required to Reduce Time"
"options.hsg.mvs.voteduration" : "Time Reduction"
"options.hsg.mvs.voteduration.detail" : "This option does not subtract time; it sets the remaining time to this value."
"options.hsg.mvs.disableonthresholdreached" : "Disable at Threshold"
"options.hsg.mvs.disableonthresholdreached.detail" : "When the remaining player count is at or below this value, the vote time change is disabled."
